## JSON Output Schema (`schema_version: "1.0"`)

```json
{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "repository": {
    "root": "/path/to/project",
    "name": "project"
  },
  "metadata": {
    "parser_version": "0.1.0",
    "generated_at": "2026-10-17T00:32:55.533000Z",
    "languages": ["python", "typescript", "go", "rust"]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "file:src/app.py",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "app.py",
      "file_path": "src/app.py",
      "start_line": 1,
      "end_line": 45,
      "language": "python",
      "properties": {
        "extension": ".py"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "symbol:src/app.py:process_payment",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "process_payment",
      "file_path": "src/app.py",
      "start_line": 10,
      "end_line": 25,
      "language": "python",
      "parameters": ["amount", "currency"],
      "return_type": "bool",
      "parent_id": "file:src/app.py",
      "docstring": "Charge customer account and log status."
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "edge:file:src/app.py->CONTAINS->symbol:src/app.py:process_payment",
      "source": "file:src/app.py",
      "target": "symbol:src/app.py:process_payment",
      "type": "CONTAINS",
      "resolution": "resolved",
      "line": 10,
      "confidence": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:symbol:src/app.py:process_payment->CALLS->symbol:src/gateway.py:charge:18:4",
      "source": "symbol:src/app.py:process_payment",
      "target": "symbol:src/gateway.py:charge",
      "type": "CALLS",
      "resolution": "resolved",
      "line": 18,
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "metadata": {
        "called_name": "charge",
        "receiver_name": "gateway"
      }
    }
  ],
  "summary": {
    "files_scanned": 12,
    "files_parsed": 12,
    "nodes_count": 48,
    "edges_count": 62,
    "errors_count": 0
  },
  "warnings": []
}
```

### Deterministic IDs
- **File Nodes**: `file:<repo_relative_path>` (e.g. `file:backend/graph/client.py`)
- **Symbol Nodes**: `symbol:<repo_relative_path>:<qualified_name>` (e.g. `symbol:backend/graph/client.py:FalkorDBSettings.__init__`)
- **Edges**: `edge:<source_id>-><TYPE>-><target_id>` (with line/column discriminator for duplicate calls)

