## Project Structure

```text
codeparser/
├── pyproject.toml              # Packaging & dependencies (Tree-sitter pinned <0.26.0)
├── README.md                   # Full documentation & usage guide
├── src/
│   └── graphagent/
│       ├── __init__.py         # Package exports
│       ├── cli.py              # CLI entrypoint with argparse & formatting
│       ├── scanner.py          # Fast recursive file scanner & .gitignore engine
│       ├── language_registry.py# Modular language registry (8 languages + TSX)
│       ├── models.py           # Dataclass schemas (Node, Edge, GraphData, etc.)
│       ├── symbol_extractor.py # Per-file error containment & extraction manager
│       ├── relationship_resolver.py # CONTAINS, IMPORTS, CALLS, INHERITS resolver
│       ├── exporter.py         # JSON serialization & schema compliance
│       └── parsers/
│           ├── __init__.py
│           ├── base.py         # Abstract BaseParser with common helpers
│           ├── python_parser.py
│           ├── javascript_parser.py
│           ├── typescript_parser.py
│           ├── java_parser.py
│           ├── go_parser.py
│           ├── c_cpp_parser.py
│           ├── rust_parser.py
│           └── php_parser.py
└── tests/
    ├── sample_repo/            # Multi-language sample repository
    │   ├── main.py
    │   ├── service.ts
    │   ├── app.js
    │   ├── Greeter.java
    │   ├── server.go
    │   ├── engine.cpp
    │   ├── lib.rs
    │   └── router.php
    ├── test_cli.py             # CLI end-to-end and determinism tests
    ├── test_parsers.py         # All language parsers + nested funcs + syntax errors
    ├── test_resolver.py        # Containment, call, import, and inheritance tests
    └── test_scanner.py         # Scanner exclusion and gitignore tests
```

---

## Running Automated Tests

Run the test suite using `pytest`:

```bash
pytest -v
```

All 19 tests validate:
- Multi-language parser accuracy (Python, JS, TS, Java, Go, C/C++, Rust, PHP)
- Nested functions and symbol scope hierarchies
- Deterministic IDs and duplicate symbol name resolution
- Cross-file call resolution (`resolved`, `unresolved`, `inferred`)
- Inheritance and interface implementation links
- Error resilience on broken/malformed syntax
- Scanner `.gitignore` and default ignore rules
- CLI output format and referential integrity of resolved edges
